parameters.text:
=Find the URL from the Tavily search results that has the highest likelihood of providing the full PDF of this publication.

Title: {{ $('Loop Over Items').item.json.Title }} Author: {{ $('Loop Over Items').item.json['Author 1'] }}

Evaluate the supplied search results for publication relevance and evidence of full PDF availability. Prefer a direct full-text PDF link, followed by a relevant publisher or repository page with evidence of PDF access.

Return only the JSON object specified in your system instructions. Use an original URL from the Tavily results or return {"pdf_url":null} if no reasonable candidate exists.

Tavily results: {{ JSON.stringify($json.results) }}

parameters.jsCode:
return items.map(item => {
  const parsed = JSON.parse(item.json.output);

  const originalRow = $('Loop Over Items').item.json;

  return {
    json: {
      pdf_url: parsed.pdf_url,
      row_number: originalRow.row_number
    }
  };
});

parameters.text:
=Extract the original abstract of the target publication from the Tavily Extract output below.

Title: {{ $('Loop Over Items1').item.json.Title }} Author: {{ $('Loop Over Items1').item.json['Author 1'] }} Publication URL: {{ $('Loop Over Items1').item.json['Page Link'] }}

Tavily Extract output: {{ JSON.stringify($json) }}

Return only the JSON object specified in your system instructions. If the abstract is not available in the supplied content, return {"abstract":null}.

parameters.jsCode:
const data = $input.all();

return data.map(item => {
  const parsed = JSON.parse(item.json.output);

  return {
    json: {
      abstract: parsed.abstract
    }
  };
});
